exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__lens_studio__list_leaf_scenarios(args: {
  // Which lens to list scenarios from: true = the lens on the paired Spectacles device (pushes the lens first if none is running and waits for it to be ready), false = the Lens Studio preview. Omit to use the panel's current 'Execute on device' setting. Note: this switches the panel's setting, so it also applies to subsequent calls.
  onDevice?: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__lens_studio__run_leaf_scenario(args: {
  // Where to run the scenario: true = on the paired Spectacles device (pushes the lens first if none is running and waits for it to be ready), false = in the Lens Studio preview. Omit to use the panel's current 'Execute on device' setting. Note: this switches the panel's setting, so it also applies to subsequent calls.
  onDevice?: boolean;
  // Optional config overrides keyed by parameter name. Keys must already exist in the scenario's default config; unknown keys are rejected.
  parameters?: { [key: string]: string; };
  // ID of the scenario to run. Must match a scenario registered by the lens. Use list_leaf_scenarios to discover available ids.
  scenarioId: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```
